BOOK COMPONENT OVERVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Book component displays information about a book.

It receives book data through props and renders the data in a formatted
book-card layout.


CREATE THE BOOK COMPONENT FILE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

File:

src/components/Book/Book.jsx


CODE:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

import './Book.css'


export default function Book({ book }) {

  return (
    <div className="book-container">


      {/* Book cover image */}

      <div className="book-cover">

        <img
          src={book.coverImage}
          alt={book.title}
          className="cover-image"
        />

      </div>


      {/* Book information section */}

      <div className="book-info">


        {/* Book title */}

        <h2 className="book-title">
          {book.title}
        </h2>


        {/* Book author */}

        <p className="book-author">
          <strong>Author:</strong> {book.author}
        </p>


        {/* Book genre */}

        <p className="book-genre">
          <strong>Genre:</strong> {book.genre}
        </p>


        {/* Book publication year */}

        <p className="book-year">
          <strong>Published:</strong> {book.year}
        </p>


        {/* Book description */}

        <p className="book-description">
          {book.description}
        </p>


        {/* Book rating */}

        <div className="book-rating">

          <strong>Rating:</strong>

          <span className="rating-stars">
            {'⭐'.repeat(book.rating)}
          </span>

          <span className="rating-value">
            ({book.rating}/5)
          </span>

        </div>


        {/* Book price */}

        <p className="book-price">
          <strong>Price:</strong> ${book.price}
        </p>

      </div>


      {/* Action buttons */}

      <div className="book-actions">

        <button className="btn-add-to-cart">
          Add to Cart
        </button>

        <button className="btn-view-details">
          View Details
        </button>

      </div>

    </div>
  )
}


LINE-BY-LINE CODE EXPLANATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

+----------------------------------+-------------------------------------------+
| CODE / CONCEPT                   | WHAT IT DOES                              |
+----------------------------------+-------------------------------------------+
| import './Book.css'              | Imports Book component CSS                |
| function Book({ book })          | Creates component and destructures prop   |
| book-container                   | Main Book component container             |
| book-cover                       | Container for book cover image            |
| src={book.coverImage}            | Uses book cover URL                       |
| alt={book.title}                 | Provides image alternative text          |
| {book.title}                     | Displays book title                      |
| {book.author}                    | Displays author                          |
| {book.genre}                     | Displays genre                           |
| {book.year}                      | Displays publication year                |
| {book.description}               | Displays description                     |
| book-rating                      | Groups rating information                |
| '⭐'.repeat(book.rating)          | Displays stars based on rating           |
| ({book.rating}/5)                | Displays numeric rating                  |
| ${book.price}                    | Displays book price                      |
| book-actions                     | Container for action buttons             |
| btn-add-to-cart                  | Add to Cart button                       |
| btn-view-details                 | View Details button                      |
