MISTAKE 1: NOT USING AN INDEX FILE
================================================================================

DIRECT IMPORT APPROACH:

import Book from './components/Book/Book'
import UserProfile from './components/UserProfile/UserProfile'


BARREL/INDEX IMPORT APPROACH:

import { Book, UserProfile } from './components'


WHY AN INDEX FILE CAN HELP:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• Cleaner Imports
  - Shorter import statements

• Easier Refactoring
  - Internal export paths are centralized

• Scalability
  - New exported components can be added to the index

• Clear Public API
  - Defines which components the directory exposes


